  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You attune your primal spirit to the celestial cycles of Eberron's twelve moons, communing with the lunar ascendance of Olarune, Therane, and Zarantyr. You can cast <em>mist</em> and <em>moonbeam</em> each once per day as primal innate spells. Your spellcasting ability for these spells is your choice of Wisdom or Charisma.</p><p>In addition, at night under an open sky illuminated by any of Eberron's moons, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Nature and Survival checks.</p>"
    },
